	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r02_boy2a_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねーねー▼
いまから　すごいことするから
みててくれない？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T05:26:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねーねー▼
いまから　すごいことするから
みててくれない？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T05:26:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanではメッセージ/処理変更予定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T11:23:18" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T10:42:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r02_boy2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　げんきが　なくて
たたかわせたくない　ときは……▽
みちを　あるけば　いいよ！▼
ポケモンが　とびだすのは　くさむらさ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　元気が　なくて
戦わせたくない　ときは……▽
道を　歩けば　いいよ！▼
ポケモンが　飛びだすのは　草むらさ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanではメッセージ変更予定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T11:23:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r02_girl2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>トレーナーとの　ポケモンしょうぶは
にげられない　しんけんしょうぶ　よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>トレーナーとの　ポケモン勝負は
逃げることは　許されない　真剣勝負よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・漢字モード、2行目19文字
※swanはメッセージ変更予定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T11:23:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
